]633;E;cat <<'EOF'\x0aFrom: Alex Hoffmann <alex@dotstartech.com>\x0aDate: Thu, 20 Aug 2026 15:00:00 +0200\x0aSubject: [PATCH] Use NXP PN7160 proprietary protocol/discovery mappings\x0a\x0aThe Linux (non-ANDROID) NfcAdaptation::Initialize does not read\x0aNFA_PROPRIETARY_CFG from configuration, so the AOSP defaults are\x0acompiled in. Those defaults contain discovery types (POLL_KOVIO=0x77,\x0aPOLL_B_PRIME=0x74) that the PN7160 rejects: RF_DISCOVER_CMD fails with\x0aSYNTAX_ERROR(0x05) and tag discovery never starts.\x0a\x0aBake in the values NXP ships in libnfc-nxp.conf for the PN7160\x0a(NFA_PROPRIETARY_CFG={05, FF, FF, 06, 81, 80, 70, FF, FF}).\x0a\x0aSigned-off-by: Alex Hoffmann <alex@dotstartech.com>\x0a---\x0aEOF\x0a;036ef2ca-dd05-41f4-a356-9f1df2b58a24]633;CFrom: Alex Hoffmann <alex@dotstartech.com>
Date: Thu, 20 Aug 2026 15:00:00 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] Use NXP PN7160 proprietary protocol/discovery mappings

The Linux (non-ANDROID) NfcAdaptation::Initialize does not read
NFA_PROPRIETARY_CFG from configuration, so the AOSP defaults are
compiled in. Those defaults contain discovery types (POLL_KOVIO=0x77,
POLL_B_PRIME=0x74) that the PN7160 rejects: RF_DISCOVER_CMD fails with
SYNTAX_ERROR(0x05) and tag discovery never starts.

Bake in the values NXP ships in libnfc-nxp.conf for the PN7160
(NFA_PROPRIETARY_CFG={05, FF, FF, 06, 81, 80, 70, FF, FF}).

Signed-off-by: Alex Hoffmann <alex@dotstartech.com>
---
--- a/src/nxp_nci_hal_libnfc-nci/src/nfa/dm/nfa_dm_cfg.cc
+++ b/src/nxp_nci_hal_libnfc-nci/src/nfa/dm/nfa_dm_cfg.cc
@@ -96,15 +96,15 @@
 
 bool nfa_poll_bail_out_mode = false;
 tNFA_PROPRIETARY_CFG nfa_proprietary_cfg = {
-    0x80, /* NCI_PROTOCOL_18092_ACTIVE */
-    0x81, /* NCI_PROTOCOL_B_PRIME */
-    0x82, /* NCI_PROTOCOL_DUAL */
-    0x83, /* NCI_PROTOCOL_15693 */
-    0x8A, /* NCI_PROTOCOL_KOVIO */
-    0xFF, /* NCI_PROTOCOL_MIFARE */
-    0x77, /* NCI_DISCOVERY_TYPE_POLL_KOVIO */
-    0x74, /* NCI_DISCOVERY_TYPE_POLL_B_PRIME */
-    0xF4, /* NCI_DISCOVERY_TYPE_LISTEN_B_PRIME */
+    0x05, /* NCI_PROTOCOL_18092_ACTIVE */
+    0xFF, /* NCI_PROTOCOL_B_PRIME (unsupported) */
+    0xFF, /* NCI_PROTOCOL_DUAL (unsupported) */
+    0x06, /* NCI_PROTOCOL_15693 */
+    0x81, /* NCI_PROTOCOL_KOVIO */
+    0x80, /* NCI_PROTOCOL_MIFARE */
+    0x70, /* NCI_DISCOVERY_TYPE_POLL_KOVIO */
+    0xFF, /* NCI_DISCOVERY_TYPE_POLL_B_PRIME (unsupported) */
+    0xFF, /* NCI_DISCOVERY_TYPE_LISTEN_B_PRIME (unsupported) */
 };
 
 tNFA_PROPRIETARY_CFG* p_nfa_proprietary_cfg =
